omething white because it gives forth a pleasant result\r\nbut--since within the particular mental stream this is also mixed with\r\nsuffering--we can also say it ripens into something black.\r\n\r\nZAG MED KYI LAS NI MI DKAR MI GNAG RNAM PAR MI SMIN LA, NAG PO DE ZAD PAR "
